<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span lang=EN-GB
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Boyları 25
metreden 30 metreye kadar olanlardan                                               (15.000,00
TL)</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
