style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Boyları 30
metreden 40 metreye kadar olanlardan                                              
(30.000,00 TL)</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
